      "payload_json": {
        "geometry": "Fire Wall: line/lane delivery — wall expands at right angle from cursor position relative to character. Fire Wall is NOT point-and-click on a monster; wall placed at cursor, expanding perpendicular. Lane footprint. Fire Wall geometry per source: 'when a player casts Fire Wall, the wall expands from the cursor at a right angle to the character.'"
      },
      "source_url": "https://maxroll.gg/d2/guides/fire-wall-sorceress-guide"
    },
    {
      "abstained": 0,
      "anchor_quote": "Fire Wall: I believe this skill is the single highest damaging skill in 1.09...still fantastic in the Cow Level",
      "conf": 0.82,
      "created_date": "2026-07-18",
      "extraction_provenance": "fetched-vdm1",
      "family": "skill_loop",
      "id": 1417,
      "kit_id": "d2-firewall-sorc",
      "payload_json": {
        "loop": "Cast Fire Wall as a line of fire at enemy location or chokepoint. Fire Wall deals massive per-tick fire damage to anything walking through it. Reposition with Teleport. Chain Fire Wall casts at new angles to maintain coverage. Pre-1.10 dominant before synergy system made other builds viable."
      },
      "source_url": "https://themovingcaravan.com/threads/1-09-leveling-guide-lod-and-classic.256/"
    },
